{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the unsettling, infinite expanse of the Backrooms, where surreal visuals and eerie liminal spaces create an atmosphere of constant unease. With the help of an RC car, you'll navigate unique levels and uncover twisted truths hidden across different chapters. There are no entities lurking in the dark, but the true terror lies in the secrets you'll unravel, revealing that the greatest danger isn't what you can see, but what you have yet to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/SnapImg.png?t=1744984373\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/Snap.jpg?t=1744984373\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unnerving Reality with Deep, Unsettling Secrets That Will Twist Your Perception and Expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/ExplorationImg.png?t=1744984373\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/Exploration.gif?t=1744984373\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an Immersive Experience with Unpredictable Levels, Minimalistic Liminal Spaces, surrounded by eerie ambience ,Where stunning Visuals Meet Deep Complex Mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/RcImg.png?t=1744984373\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/Rc.gif?t=1744984373\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lost in endless, empty halls, your only companion is an RC car, helping you navigate through the eerie silence, to uncover hidden secrets and unravel the mysteries of this realm .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tape 101 is inspired by the internet fictional concept &quot;<strong>The Backrooms&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Other inspirations includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ruster :\u00a0Backrooms - Level 0 \u201cRC Car\u201d (found footage)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kauffman : Backrooms - 2005</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JD Archive :\u00a0The Backrooms - Unknown Tape (Found footage)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kane Pixels :\u00a0The Backrooms (Found Footage)</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3010380?t=1744984373","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3010380?t=1744984373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/b99ad4ee4b0e7c8b4b11a01a49cd524200ce6b8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744984373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/b99ad4ee4b0e7c8b4b1